questions.questionText:
Let  𝒖𝟏, 𝒖𝟐, 𝒖𝟑, 𝒗𝟏, 𝒗𝟐, 𝒗𝟑  be vectors in  ℝ4.  Let  𝑈  be the span of  {𝒖𝟏, 𝒖𝟐, 𝒖𝟑}  
and let  𝑉  be the span of  {𝒗𝟏, 𝒗𝟐, 𝒗𝟑}. Consider the following statements: (I)    If the dimension of  𝑈∩𝑉  is 2 and the dimension of  𝑈  is 3, then  
        {𝒗𝟏, 𝒗𝟐, 𝒗𝟑}  is linearly dependent. (II)  If  𝑈+ 𝑉= {𝒖+ 𝒗⁡ ∶𝒖∈𝑈, 𝒗∈𝑉} = ℝ4,  then either  {𝒖𝟏, 𝒖𝟐, 𝒖𝟑}   
        is linearly independent or  {𝒗𝟏, 𝒗𝟐, 𝒗𝟑}  is linearly independent. Which of the above statements is/are true?
